# Nabla contributor contract

Read AGENTS.md and docs/UI-CONSISTENCY.md before changing UI behavior.
- Device YAML owns menu content/actions; Nabla owns standard presentation.
- Shared appearance applies to system apps, overlays and embedded Nabla widgets.
- Extend shared primitives/profiles instead of local fonts, borders or gestures.
- Preserve the tested touch/encoder behavior and reachable Back/Cancel.
- Verify icon/size coverage; do not confuse existing view modes with a global API.
- Use English for project docs, comments, help and new identifiers. Preserve UI
  locale resources and user-owned names. Spanish discussion threads are allowed.
- Add short English purpose/why headers to owned source/config files; preserve
  shebangs/licenses and document JSON/generated/upstream files in a README.
- Keep private deployment YAML and credentials outside the public repository.
- Current work belongs in nabla-esp-ui, not the older esphome-ui-kit fork.
